{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/l8byds36","slide":4,"text":"Unmanaged wallet inventory stays separate. An LLM outage blocks entries; open-position rules remain deterministic.","textPreview":"Unmanaged wallet inventory stays separate. An LLM outage blocks entries; open-position rules remain deterministic.","textChars":114,"textLines":1,"bbox":[84,577,1098,48]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/34miqr","slide":4,"text":"The READ and WRITE lanes are separate MCP client processes with separate authority. The Market Critic only sees read-side evidence. The deterministic Risk Certificate gates execution. AURA also serves its own read-only status interface for outside observers. Safety rules allow one AURA-managed position, distinguish unrelated inventory, and stop under ambiguous execution or protection state. Current live entry protection remains unverified, so new live BUYs are blocked."}
